er_mute_restores_behavior(self):\n        reg = Register()\n        reg.mute()\n        assert reg(42) == \"\"\n        reg.unmute()\n        # Default eightbit_call is the identity function.\n        assert reg(42) == 42\n        assert reg(1, 2, 3) == (1, 2, 3)\n```",
